{title: Iravukku Aayiram Kangal}
{artist: Sathya Prakash Chinmayi Sripada}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Uyir Uruvaadha,        [A]Urukulaikkadha
[Dm]Yennil Vandhu Saera,        [A#]Nee Yosikkaa [A]dha?
[Dm]Dhisai Ariyaadha,        [A]Paravaiyapola?
[Dm]Parakkavum Aasa,        [A#]Unnodu [A]Dhoora?
[Dm]Vaazhkka Theera Theera,        [Gm]Vaayen Nizhalaa Kooda
[Dm]Saagum Dhooram Poga,        [Gm]Thunaiya Neeyum [C]Thaeva
[F]Naa Un Kooda,        [Dm]Un Nenappu..
[F]Nenju Kuzhi Vara [C]Irukku?        [Gm]Ye Ulagam [F]Muzhusum?
[C]Unna Suththi Suththi Kedaku?        [Dm]Un Nenappu..
[F]Nenju Kuzhi Vara [C]Irukku?        [Gm]Ye Ulagam [F]Muzhusum?
[C]Unna Suththi Suththi Kedaku?        [Dm]Manasula Oru Vidha Validhaan?
[Gm]Sugama Sugama?        [Dm]Enakkulla Urukkura Unna Neeyum?
[Gm]Nejama [Dm]Nejama?        Kanne Kanne?
[Dm]Kaalam Dhorum?        [Dm]Enkooda [G]Nee Mattum?
[A]Podhum [Gm]Podhum,        [Dm]Nee Naalum
